{"seq":2,"slug":"data-contracts","title":"数据契约标准与 ODCS 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/architecture/data-contracts","wordCount":1100,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据契约标准与-odcs-实践\">数据契约标准与 ODCS 实践</h1><p>当数据从一个域流向另一个域时，如果没有契约约束，任何上游变更都是一次信任赌博。列名重命名、类型更改、NULL 策略调整——这些&quot;小&quot;变更在集中式架构中尚且危险，在去中心化的数据网格中则可能引发级联故障。数据契约（Data Contract）正是数据世界的 OpenAPI 规范——它将隐式假设变为显式承诺，使信任可验证、可执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据契约是生产者与消费者之间的一份<strong>技术协议</strong>，定义了数据产品的结构、语义、质量标准和服务承诺。截至 2026 年，两个主要规范主导了这个领域：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Producer[数据生产者] --&gt;|发布| Contract[数据契约&lt;br/&gt;YAML 定义]&#10;    Contract --&gt;|验证| CI[CI/CD 管道]&#10;    CI --&gt;|执行| QualityCheck[质量检查]&#10;    Contract --&gt;|注册| Catalog[数据目录]&#10;    Consumer[数据消费者] --&gt;|查阅| Catalog&#10;    Consumer --&gt;|依赖| Contract&#10;    Contract --&gt;|约束| Data[实际数据]&#10;    QualityCheck --&gt;|通过/失败| Alert[告警]\">flowchart LR\n    Producer[数据生产者] --&gt;|发布| Contract[数据契约&lt;br/&gt;YAML 定义]\n    Contract --&gt;|验证| CI[CI/CD 管道]\n    CI --&gt;|执行| QualityCheck[质量检查]\n    Contract --&gt;|注册| Catalog[数据目录]\n    Consumer[数据消费者] --&gt;|查阅| Catalog\n    Consumer --&gt;|依赖| Contract\n    Contract --&gt;|约束| Data[实际数据]\n    QualityCheck --&gt;|通过/失败| Alert[告警]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规范</th>\n<th>治理方</th>\n<th>版本（2026）</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ODCS（Open Data Contract Standard）</td>\n<td>Linux Foundation BITOL</td>\n<td>v3.1.0</td>\n<td>企业级、PayPal 起源、覆盖全面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data Contract Specification</td>\n<td>datacontract.com / Entropy Data</td>\n<td>v1.x</td>\n<td>开发者友好、CLI 工具完善</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个规范都使用 YAML 格式，且团队正在积极协调融合。ODCS 在 Linux Foundation 的中立治理下已成为事实标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"odcs-的起源与演进\">ODCS 的起源与演进</h2><p>ODCS 源自 PayPal 的内部数据网格实践。PayPal 在实施数据网格时发现，域间数据共享需要比 schema 文件更丰富的协议。他们开发了内部的 Data Contract Template，后开源捐赠给 Linux Foundation 旗下的 BITOL 项目。</p>\n<p>演进时间线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2022：PayPal 开源其内部格式</li>\n<li>2023：BITOL 项目成立，社区化标准制定</li>\n<li>2024：ODCS v3.0 发布，引入逻辑/物理类型分离</li>\n<li>2025.12：ODCS v3.1.0 发布，加入关系定义、更严格验证、可执行 SLA</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"odcs-v3-1-的核心组成\">ODCS v3.1 的核心组成</h2><p>一份完整的 ODCS 契约包含十个主要段落：</p>\n<h3 id=\"schema-定义\">Schema 定义</h3><p>Schema 是契约的结构骨架，使用逻辑类型与物理类型双层描述：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"schema:&#10;  - name: payment_id&#10;    logicalType: string&#10;    physicalType: VARCHAR(36)&#10;    isNullable: false&#10;    isPrimaryKey: true&#10;    description: &#39;唯一支付标识符（UUID 格式）&#39;&#10;  - name: amount&#10;    logicalType: decimal&#10;    physicalType: NUMERIC(12,2)&#10;    isNullable: false&#10;    description: &#39;支付金额（以 currency 字段指定的货币计）&#39;&#10;  - name: currency&#10;    logicalType: string&#10;    physicalType: VARCHAR(3)&#10;    isNullable: false&#10;    description: &#39;ISO 4217 货币代码&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    logicalType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    physicalType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VARCHAR(36)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    isNullable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    isPrimaryKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'唯一支付标识符（UUID 格式）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    logicalType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">decimal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    physicalType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NUMERIC(12,2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    isNullable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付金额（以 currency 字段指定的货币计）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    logicalType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    physicalType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VARCHAR(3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    isNullable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ISO 4217 货币代码'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>逻辑/物理类型分离的意义：同一份契约可以描述落地到 BigQuery、Snowflake 或 Redshift 的数据，通过类型映射适配不同平台。</p>\n<h3 id=\"质量规则\">质量规则</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"quality:&#10;  - name: amount_is_positive&#10;    type: custom&#10;    dimension: accuracy&#10;    rule: &#39;amount &gt; 0&#39;&#10;    severity: error&#10;  - name: currency_is_valid&#10;    type: custom&#10;    dimension: validity&#10;    rule: &quot;currency IN (&#39;USD&#39;, &#39;EUR&#39;, &#39;GBP&#39;, &#39;CNY&#39;)&quot;&#10;    severity: warning\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">quality</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">amount_is_positive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">custom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    dimension</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">accuracy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'amount > 0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">currency_is_valid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">custom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    dimension</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">validity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"currency IN ('USD', 'EUR', 'GBP', 'CNY')\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warning</span></span></code></pre></div><p>质量规则是<strong>声明式</strong>的——描述&quot;什么应该为真&quot;，而非&quot;如何检查&quot;。工具（如 Soda、Data Contract CLI）将其翻译为对实际数据的可执行检查。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sla-属性\">SLA 属性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"slaProperties:&#10;  - property: latency&#10;    value: &#39;4h&#39;&#10;    description: &#39;数据在事件发生后 4 小时内可用&#39;&#10;  - property: availability&#10;    value: &#39;99.9%&#39;&#10;  - property: freshness&#10;    value: &#39;1h&#39;&#10;    description: &#39;最新记录的最大年龄&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">slaProperties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">latency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4h'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数据在事件发生后 4 小时内可用'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">availability</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'99.9%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">freshness</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1h'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'最新记录的最大年龄'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SLA 是数据契约超越 dbt contract 的关键维度——dbt 可以强制列和类型正确，但无法承诺&quot;数据 4 小时内可用&quot;或&quot;管道 99.9% 可用&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"所有权与治理\">所有权与治理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"team:&#10;  - name: seller-platform&#10;    role: producer&#10;    contact: seller-platform@company.com&#10;  - name: analytics-engineering&#10;    role: consumer&#10;    contact: analytics@company.com\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">team</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">seller-platform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">producer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    contact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">seller-platform@company.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">analytics-engineering</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">consumer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    contact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">analytics@company.com</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"数据契约的生命周期\">数据契约的生命周期</h2><p>数据契约不是一次性文件，而是随产品演进的活文档：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Draft[草稿] --&gt; Review[评审]&#10;    Review --&gt; Active[生效]&#10;    Active --&gt; Evolution[演进]&#10;    Evolution --&gt;|向后兼容| Active&#10;    Evolution --&gt;|Breaking Change| NewMajor[新主版本]&#10;    NewMajor --&gt; Deprecation[旧版本废弃期]&#10;    Deprecation --&gt; Retired[退役]\">flowchart LR\n    Draft[草稿] --&gt; Review[评审]\n    Review --&gt; Active[生效]\n    Active --&gt; Evolution[演进]\n    Evolution --&gt;|向后兼容| Active\n    Evolution --&gt;|Breaking Change| NewMajor[新主版本]\n    NewMajor --&gt; Deprecation[旧版本废弃期]\n    Deprecation --&gt; Retired[退役]</pre><p><strong>版本策略原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>向后兼容变更（新增可选字段、放宽约束）→ minor 版本升级</li>\n<li>Breaking change（删字段、改类型、收紧约束）→ major 版本升级 + 废弃期</li>\n<li>消费者应绑定 major 版本范围（如 <code>^3.0</code>）而非精确版本</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"契约驱动的开发工作流\">契约驱动的开发工作流</h2><p>将数据契约嵌入 CI/CD 的实践模式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>契约先行（Contract-First）</strong>：在写第一行转换代码之前先定义契约</li>\n<li><strong>Schema 验证</strong>：PR 中对契约变更做向后兼容检查</li>\n<li><strong>数据验证</strong>：管道产出后自动运行契约中定义的质量规则</li>\n<li><strong>契约发布</strong>：验证通过后将契约注册到数据目录</li>\n<li><strong>消费者通知</strong>：breaking change 自动通知订阅该契约的下游团队</li>\n</ol>\n<p>开源工具 Data Contract CLI 支持完整的上述工作流：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 验证契约语法&#10;datacontract lint my-contract.yaml&#10;&#10;# 对实际数据运行质量检查&#10;datacontract test my-contract.yaml --server production&#10;&#10;# 检查两个版本间的 breaking change&#10;datacontract breaking my-contract-v2.yaml my-contract-v1.yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证契约语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">datacontract</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-contract.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对实际数据运行质量检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">datacontract</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-contract.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --server</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查两个版本间的 breaking change</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">datacontract</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> breaking</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-contract-v2.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-contract-v1.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"agentic-ai-时代的数据契约\">Agentic AI 时代的数据契约</h2><p>2026 年，随着 Agentic AI 的兴起，数据契约获得了新的战略意义。AI Agent 需要自主发现和消费数据——数据契约是 Agent 理解&quot;这份数据可不可用&quot;的机器可读接口。Simon Harrer（BITOL TSC 成员）在 2026 年 Data Mesh Belgium Meetup 上预测：&quot;四年后数据契约将像 OpenAPI 一样无处不在。&quot;</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据契约 = 数据世界的 OpenAPI，将隐式假设变为可执行承诺</li>\n<li>ODCS v3.1.0 是当前事实标准（Linux Foundation BITOL 治理）</li>\n<li>契约覆盖 schema + 质量规则 + SLA + 所有权——比传统 schema 文件丰富得多</li>\n<li>契约需版本管理，breaking change 需通知消费者并提供废弃期</li>\n<li>AI Agent 的兴起使数据契约的机器可读性成为战略必需</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"data-product-quantum\">数据产品量子结构</a>——契约如何嵌入量子的输出端口</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/testing-operations/experimentation-platform\">A/B 测试实验平台</a>——契约在实验数据管道中的应用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据契约标准与 ODCS 实践","id":"数据契约标准与-odcs-实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ODCS 的起源与演进","id":"odcs-的起源与演进"},{"level":2,"text":"ODCS v3.1 的核心组成","id":"odcs-v3-1-的核心组成"},{"level":3,"text":"Schema 定义","id":"schema-定义"},{"level":3,"text":"质量规则","id":"质量规则"},{"level":3,"text":"SLA 属性","id":"sla-属性"},{"level":3,"text":"所有权与治理","id":"所有权与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"数据契约的生命周期","id":"数据契约的生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"契约驱动的开发工作流","id":"契约驱动的开发工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"Agentic AI 时代的数据契约","id":"agentic-ai-时代的数据契约"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"数据产品量子结构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/architecture/data-product-quantum"},"next":{"title":"数据网格与数据编织的对比定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/architecture/mesh-vs-fabric"}}